        "id": 8341
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-09-18T18:49:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Currently I don\u0027t think we\u0027d ever take these cases because we aren\u0027t calling drawGeometry() with tile Geometries directly. They are only produced as a result of the strip generator that\u0027s run after chooseRenderer() is called, right?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 2202,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 2206,
        "endChar": 58
      },
      "revId": "c9056b49d9dc8fd0044c7e56770387dd57ef2c75",
